# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your key(s). `.env` is gitignored.
#
# USDA FoodData Central API key (food search / barcode fallback).
# Get a free one at https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/api-key-signup
# Leave as DEMO_KEY for light use (~30 requests/hour/IP); a real key gives 1,000/hr.
#
# NOTE: this is a static client app — Vite inlines VITE_* vars into the shipped
# JS at build time, so this key IS visible in the deployed public bundle. That's
# fine here because a data.gov key is free and rate-limited per caller IP. Do NOT
# put any billable/account key in a VITE_ var.
VITE_USDA_KEY=DEMO_KEY
